1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:03,330
your ai built a telegram bot.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:04,710
it says it works.

3
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:06,750
you open telegram,

4
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,110
you tap the button,

5
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:09,570
nothing happens.

6
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:11,460
so you screenshot it,

7
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,510
paste it back, and explain.

8
00:00:14,238 --> 00:00:17,028
graea gives your ai its own eyes.

9
00:00:17,338 --> 00:00:19,058
it logs in as a test user

10
00:00:19,098 --> 00:00:20,948
and messages your bot.

11
00:00:21,158 --> 00:00:22,798
it taps the inline button

12
00:00:22,838 --> 00:00:23,798
like a person would.

13
00:00:23,838 --> 00:00:25,438
it screenshots the chat

14
00:00:25,478 --> 00:00:27,638
as telegram renders it.

15
00:00:27,678 --> 00:00:29,198
a vision model reads it,

16
00:00:29,238 --> 00:00:30,828
you choose which one.

17
00:00:31,218 --> 00:00:33,738
expected an order summary,

18
00:00:33,778 --> 00:00:34,978
saw nothing,

19
00:00:35,018 --> 00:00:36,908
the callback never answered.

20
00:00:37,706 --> 00:00:40,236
markdown, truncated buttons,

21
00:00:40,406 --> 00:00:41,746
missing captions.

22
00:00:41,786 --> 00:00:43,216
it catches those.

23
00:00:43,666 --> 00:00:47,756
every step goes into duckdb log.

24
00:00:48,766 --> 00:00:50,836
run one, three failures.

25
00:00:51,166 --> 00:00:54,056
your ai plugs in over mcp,

26
00:00:54,294 --> 00:00:55,574
the ai reads what broke

27
00:00:55,614 --> 00:00:57,224
and patches the bot.

28
00:00:57,894 --> 00:00:59,174
graea runs it again.

29
00:00:59,214 --> 00:01:00,984
run two, one failure.

30
00:01:01,694 --> 00:01:03,494
run three, all passed.

31
00:01:03,534 --> 00:01:05,124
the diff shows the progress.

32
00:01:05,334 --> 00:01:07,764
no human relaying screenshots.

33
00:01:08,674 --> 00:01:10,744
graea, source available.

34
00:01:11,254 --> 00:01:12,644
usufruct licensing.

35
00:01:12,934 --> 00:01:14,764
ufl all the way.

